- Excellent charging function, constant voltage provides a stable product; 
- Switching power voltage Adaptor from 110V - 240V AC; 
- USA Plug; 
- Cigarette Lighter Adaptor for use in Car, Van, Track or Boat; 
- Constant voltage charging and current controlling automatically, make product safer; 
- Short circuit protection; 
- Slim, portable and lightweight design; 
- Smart LED Indicator, It will turn to green after charging fully. 

Compatible Battery Models: 
- AIPTEK IS-DV EE Battery Pack; 
- AIPTEK POCKET DV5700 EE Battery Pack. 

Specifications: 
Input Voltage: 
 - AC 110V-240V, 
 - DC 12V-24V; 
Dimensions: 105x60x35mm.
